        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Traseem, The Great Seabird wields a massive scythe. All of their strikes with The Reaper's Call affect a 15 foot cone. Roll the attack once and compare the result to the AC of all targets. The cone may be angled however you wish and a target does not need to be within 30ft to be struck by the cone. Traseem is immune to their own strikes and is <strong>immune to being disarmed.</strong></p>"
        },
