        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>As they are bound, Traseem shrieks in frustration, unbinding players from their items. All players attempt a @Check[will|dc:28|traits:aura,divine,teleportation]. This affects all PCs only once, at the beginning of the encounter. Uninvested items can not include armour. If a Tattoo, Graft or similar item is targeted it is simply turned off for the day (this should not destroy any items). See the Varceta Finale journal entry for how these items can be retrieved.</p><p>(This ability can be modified by Modification: Trifling Trinkets)</p><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> One of the creature's invested items (at random) is uninvested and teleported to the Ethereal Plane.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> One of the creature's held weapons, shields, or items (at random) is teleported to the Ethereal Plane. One of their invested items (at random) is also uninvested teleported.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> Two of the creature's held weapons, shields, or items (at random) are teleported to the Ethereal Plane. Two of their invested items (at random) are also uninvested teleported.</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "authors": "",
