        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The Reaper's Call is coated in a thin ghostly poison. Their first successful strike each round, even if that Strike does no damage (such as due to resistance) applies Death Chill. If several people are struck at once it affects them all.</p><p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:27|traits:poison];</p><p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds;</p><p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[2d4[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1} (1 round);</p><p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[3d4[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1} (1 round);</p><p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @Damage[5d4[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 2} (1 round).</p>"
