          "value": "<p><strong>Requirement </strong>It is Traseem's first turn, OR Traseem used Tides Rush Out last round. Either Waves Crash In or Tides Rush Out <strong>MUST </strong>be used on each of Traseem's turns, and never both.</p><p><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, sans-serif\">Ethereal waves crash over the battlefield. All creatures on either plane standing outside the circle of bones take </span>@Damage[6d6[cold]] damage with a @Check[fortitude|dc:29|basic|traits:cold,divine,area-effect] save. On a failure, creatures are also pulled 15 feet towards Traseem, or adjacent to Traseem on a critical failure. This never pulls a creature off the battlefield (ie into lava).</p>"
