        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Requirement </strong>Traseem used Waves Crash In last round. Either Tides Rush Out or Waves Crash In <strong>MUST </strong>be used on each of Traseem's turns, and never both.</p><p>The ethereal waves rush back out to sea. All creatures on either plane standing within the ring of bones take @Damage[6d6[bludgeoning]] damage with a @Check[reflex|dc:29|basic|traits:divine,water,area-effect]. On a failure, creatures are pushed 15 feet away from Traseem, or to the edge of the 40 foot ring on a critical failure. This effect never pushes a creature off the battlefield (ie into lava).</p>"
